{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "c31cd165-33dc-4b9f-8c07-4cc64c65a813",
      "name": "markets",
      "description": {
        "content": "Markets are the electricity markets in which you can participate.\nEach market has a set of eligibility criteria, which you can query to see if you can participate in a certain market.\n\nRead our [guide](/guides/connect/markets) for more information.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "ba27d5fd-380b-442e-80fc-523304541639",
          "name": "Site markets",
          "request": {
            "name": "Site markets",
            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieves the markets a site can have access to.\n\nWhether a market is available or not depends on the combination of a few factors:\n\n- Whether or not the owner of the site is contractually connected to the market via its supplier\n- Whether or not the site is located in the market's service area (geographically)\n\n- Whether or not the site and its resources meet the market's eligibility criteria (technical requirements)\n\nThe result contains all contractually available markets, with a `status` property indicating whether or not the site can access the market.\n\nThe different values of the market status of a site are:\n\n- `active` - The site is active on this market.\n\n- `ineligible` - The site is not eligible for this market (for example due to technical, or geographical reasons).\n\n- `action_required` - Further action is required from the site to activate this market.\n\nWhen the status is `action_required`, further action is required to activate the market. Look at the `action` property for more information.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "connect",
                "sites",
                ":id",
                "markets"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<uuid>",
                  "key": "id",
                  "description": "(Required) Identifier of the site you want to get markets for."
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{bearerToken}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
